sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User as CLI / Dashboard
    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>443/TCP passthrough
    participant GW as openshell-gateway<br/>8080/TCP gRPC TLS 1.2/1.3
    participant IdP as OIDC Issuer<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant ASC as Agent Sandbox Controller
    participant Sup as openshell-supervisor<br/>5500/TCP gRPC TLS
    participant SB as Sandbox Pod<br/>agent + openshell-sandbox
    participant Ext as Approved Endpoint<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over User,ASC: Flow 1 - User creates a sandbox
    User->>Route: CreateSandbox gRPC h2<br/>TLS, OIDC bearer and/or mTLS
    Route->>GW: TLS passthrough to 8080/TCP
    GW->>IdP: Fetch JWKS, cached 3600s<br/>HTTPS, no auth
    IdP-->>GW: JWKS
    GW->>GW: Method + workspace authz
    GW->>K8s: Create Sandbox CR, Secrets, NetworkPolicy<br/>HTTPS, gateway SA token
    K8s-->>ASC: Watch Sandbox CR
    ASC->>SB: Schedule sandbox Pod + supervisor
    GW-->>User: Sandbox created

    Note over Sup,K8s: Flow 2 - Supervisor bootstrap and control channel
    Sup->>GW: IssueSandboxToken 8080/TCP<br/>TLS client cert, projected SA token
    GW->>K8s: TokenReview + pod name/UID lookup<br/>HTTPS, gateway SA
    K8s-->>GW: Identity confirmed
    GW-->>Sup: Ed25519 sandbox JWT, TTL 1h
    Sup->>GW: ConnectSupervisor / PushSandboxLogs / Report*<br/>gRPC stream, sandbox JWT
    GW-->>Sup: Policy and config delivery

    Note over SB,Ext: Flow 3 - Agent egress to approved provider
    SB->>Sup: HTTP/CONNECT 5500/TCP or local<br/>TLS pinned, workload identity
    Sup->>Sup: OPA/Rego + middleware evaluation
    Sup->>Ext: HTTPS 443/TCP TLS 1.2+<br/>injected provider credential
    Ext-->>Sup: Response
    Sup-->>SB: Response, credential never exposed

    Note over User,SB: Flow 4 - Interactive exec / SSH
    User->>GW: ExecSandboxInteractive / CreateSshSession<br/>8080/TCP TLS, OIDC + workspace authz
    GW->>SB: SSH 2222/TCP<br/>gateway-issued session key, NetworkPolicy gateway-only
    SB-->>GW: Session stream
    GW-->>User: Terminal stream
